  <text xml:lang="ta" type="edition">
    <body>

        <div xml:id="AN269.1-kilavi">
          <p type="edition">piriviṭai vēṟupaṭṭa talaimakaḷait tōḻi vaṟpuṟuttatu.</p>
          <p type="translation" xml:lang="en">How the confidante comforted HER who had undergone changes in the time of separation.</p>
        </div>
        <div rend="parallel">
      <lg xml:id="AN269.1">
        <l><anchor n="1"/>toṭitō ḷivarka vevvamun tīrka</l>
        <l>neṟiyiruṅ katuppiṟ kōtaiyum puṉaika</l>
        <l>vēṟuṭai yiṉanirai peyarap peyarātu</l>
        <l>ceṟicurai vēla maḻavart tāṅkiya</l>
        <l>taṟukaṇ ṇāḷar nallicai niṟumār</l>
        <l>piṭimaṭin taṉṉa kuṟumpoṟai maruṅki</l>
        <l>ṉaṭṭa pōlu nāṭāa neṭuṅka</l>
        <l>lakaliṭaṅ kuyiṉṟa palpeyar maṇṇi</l>
        <l>naṟuvirai mañca <supplied>ḷī</supplied>rmpuṟam poliya</l>
        <l>vampukoṇ ṭaṟutta vārnā rurivaiyiṟ</l>
        <l>cempūṅ karantai puṉainta kaṇṇi</l>
        <l>varivaṇ ṭārppac cūṭṭik kaḻaṟkā </l>
        <l>liṉaipatip peyaru maṭuñcura miṟantōr</l>
        <l>taii niṉṟa taṇpeya<supplied>ṟ</supplied> kaṭaināṭ</l>
        <l>polaṅkācu niraitta kōṭēn talku</l>
        <l>ṉalaṅkēḻ mākkural kuḻaiyoṭu tuyalvarap</l>
        <l>pāṭūr peḻiṟarum pakuvāy maṇṭilattu</l>
        <l>vayiṟiṭaip paṭṭa teḷviḷi yiyampa</l>
        <l>vaṇṭaṟ pāvai yuṇṭuṟait tarīit</l>
        <l>tirunutaṉ makaḷir kuravai yayarum</l>
        <l>peruni<supplied>ḻa</supplied>ṟ kāṉa <supplied>ṟa</supplied>ḻīiya virukkai </l>
        <l>vāṇaṉ ciṟukuṭi vaṇaṅkukatir nelliṉ</l>
        <l>yāṇart taṇpaṇaip pōtuvā <supplied>yavi</supplied>ḻnta</l>
        <l>voṇceṅ kaḻunī raṉṉaniṉ</l>
        <l>kaṇpaṉi tuṭaimār vantaṉar viraintē.</l>
      </lg>
      <lg type="translation" xml:lang="en">
        <l corresp="1">Let the bangles rise up the arm [again], let the trouble end,</l>
        <l corresp="2">and let a garland decorate [your] curly dark hair!</l>
        <l corresp="13cd">He who traversed the murderous desert, where they </l>
        <l corresp="8">bathe the many names engraved in the wide surface</l>
        <l corresp="7">of the tall stones they did not seek, that resemble [hero stones] that were erected</l>
        <l corresp="6">on short hillocks that are like resting elephant cows</l>
        <l corresp="5">in order to establish the fame of valorous men</l>
        <l corresp="3">who, without moving when the bull-possessing herds move,</l>
        <l corresp="4">endured [a fight with] the warriors whose spear have tight ferrules,</l>
        <l corresp="9">[bathe them] so that [their] wet outer surfaces shine with fragrant, scented turmeric,</l>
        <l corresp="12a-c">adorn [them], so that striped bees hum around [them],</l>
        <l corresp="11">with chaplets fashioned of red-flowered Karantai</l>
        <l corresp="10">[and] with ebony bark skins that were cut out by arrows,</l>
        <l corresp="12d-13b">[and, their] feet ankleted, return to [their] desperate abode,</l>
        <l corresp="25">he has come [back] fast in order to wipe the tears from your eyes</l>
        <l corresp="24">which are like bright red lotuses</l>
        <l corresp="23">that opened [their] bud mouths in the fertile cool wet-fields</l>
        <l corresp="22">of paddy with bowing ears in the little hamlet of Vāṇaṉ,</l>
        <l corresp="21">a seat that is encompassed by the big shady seashore grove,</l>
        <l corresp="14">where, on the final day of lingering cool rains in [the month of] Tai,</l>
        <l corresp="15">so that [their] hips with eminent curves on which gold beads have been put in a row</l>
        <l corresp="16">[and their] beautiful, lustrous dark curls along with [their] earrings come into swinging,</l>
        <l corresp="18">while the clear note sounds that comes from inside the belly</l>
        <l corresp="17">of the orb with split mouth(?)  that gives grace as singing spreads,</l>
        <l corresp="19">having brought [their] Vaṇṭal dolls to the drinking ghat,</l>
        <l corresp="20">girls with luminous foreheads engage in the Kuravai [dance].</l>
      </lg>
        </div>
